        "f6000006-0000-4000-8000-0000000000ff": {
            "content": "## ⚠️ Test data assumption\n\n- Appmixer account: auth+hubspot@appmixer.com (service appmixer:hubspot), HubSpot portal 148964607 (developer test account).\n- The HubSpot app's webhook target URL must point at this Appmixer instance (own app: appId + apiKey in the service config) — the trigger registers its subscription at flow start.\n- **Custom contact property `e2e_watched_note` must exist** (string/text, group contactinformation). Create it once: HubSpot MakeApiCall `POST /crm/v3/properties/contacts` `{\"name\":\"e2e_watched_note\",\"label\":\"E2E Watched Note\",\"type\":\"string\",\"fieldType\":\"text\",\"groupName\":\"contactinformation\"}`.\n- ContactPropertyChanged subscribes to `e2e_watched_note` itself at flow start (own app only; with AuthHub the property has to be added in the HubSpot app's webhook settings).\n- The creation-time email/name events must not fire it — the Assert expects the custom value. The cleanup after AfterAll deletes the contact by the trigger output.\n- The Waits must stay: subscription propagation and create → update spacing.",
